index 0000000..d8e0e2e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/wait-no-wait-values-callable-sum-a15c2a97f24bc2f0.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``wait=None``, ``wait=0`` and ``wait=sum([])`` mean "no wait" again. They
+    raised ``TypeError: 'NoneType' object is not callable`` once a retry ran,
+    for both ``Retrying`` and ``AsyncRetrying``.
+  - |
+    A plain callable can be added to a wait strategy again:
+    ``my_callable + wait_fixed(1)`` returns a ``wait_combine`` that sums both.
+  - |
+    ``wait_combine`` passes the retry state to its strategies positionally, so
+    plain callables may name their parameter anything.
